      "exact_reserve_text": "For the purposes of preparing these Financial Statements, the Managing Agent has adopted its external actuarial consultants' best estimate outcome. In respect of business earned at 31 December 2017, the gross and net reserves, excluding claims handling costs and run-off provision, as at 31 December 2017 total GBP 172.9 million and GBP 125.3 million respectively. During the year there was net claims development improvement of GBP 14.7 million on the 2013 and prior years, GBP 1.9 million on the 2014 year, GBP 2.7 million on the 2015 year and an improvement of GBP 0.5 million on the 2016 year of account.",
